{"candidateAnswer":"Volunteering at homeless shelter","evidence":"[D3:5 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.\n[D2:1 | 6:10 pm on 22 December, 2022] Maria: Hey John, been a few days since we chatted. In the meantime, I donated my old car to a homeless shelter I volunteer at yesterday. How's the campaign going? I'm keen to hearabout it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a869e3fa-0e50-5f81-98b6-993979307310","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4d6525cacba47ba95ee207eac92a97552dcd7aeeeff558dec47ce068f0bfa95a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of volunteering have John and Maria both done?","referenceAnswer":"Volunteering at a homeless shelter","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4d6525cacba47ba95ee207eac92a97552dcd7aeeeff558dec47ce068f0bfa95a"}}]}